    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Founders</strong></i> <strong>is a city-building survival game for 1-10 players, where medieval robots with evolving memories and unique personalities create a truly living world. Build and defend your city against relentless threats while shaping your character\u2019s skills.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle people, animals and fantastical creatures as you traverse the wilderness for food and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152110/extras/2a80a7b683f5ebcf54f3ea023bfc2140.poster.avif?t=1741627052\" width=630 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152110/extras/2a80a7b683f5ebcf54f3ea023bfc2140.webm?t=1741627052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a settlement and create buildings for houses, shops, guilds, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152110/extras/1ffd705cc414141f64a03b828a376ab1.poster.avif?t=1741627052\" width=630 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152110/extras/1ffd705cc414141f64a03b828a376ab1.webm?t=1741627052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your settlement into a metropolis. As your settlement develops, it will gain citizens with unique personalities and backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crosso